--- Atmlab people ---

Some of the persons who have worked on Atmlab are listed below. 
Otherwise, look in header of each individual file.


Patrick Eriksson <patrick.eriksson@chalmers.se>
---
Initiated Atmlab. Made the little design there is.
Contributed with functions of various kind.


Oliver Lemke <olemke@ltu.se>
---
Maintaining SVN repository and the mailing list.
Created the XML format for data files.


Salomon Eliasson <s.eliasson@ltu.se>
---
GMT plotting interface.


Gerrit Holl <gerrit.holl@ltu.se>
---
Collocation code.


